Based on the SceneDesignerAgent's verified scene layout and all the discussion, here are my milestone rules. The yellow glazed terracotta is placed at spawn-relative positions (~10, 0, 10) and (~11, 0, 10) as a 2-wide, 2-tall pillar. For a "find" task, the preferred rule type is `position_near_with_facing`, which models "the player can see the target" by checking both proximity and facing direction.

